THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
======================

These parts are not covered by the notice above. Each keeps its own licence.

FluidAudio (Swift package dependency)
  https://github.com/FluidInference/FluidAudio
  Apache License 2.0

NVIDIA Parakeet TDT 0.6B v2 (optional download, not in this repository)
  https://huggingface.co/nvidia/parakeet-tdt-0.6b-v2
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)

Apple MobileCLIP-S2 (optional download, not in this repository)
  https://github.com/apple/ml-mobileclip
  Apple Machine Learning Research Model License, which limits the model to
  non-commercial research use

LaMa (optional download, not in this repository)
  https://github.com/advimman/lama
  Apache License 2.0. Core ML conversion by john-rocky. The weights were
  trained on Places2, whose terms are non-commercial.

MI-GAN (bundled in release builds, not in this repository)
  https://github.com/Picsart-AI-Research/MI-GAN
  MIT License. The weights were trained on Places2, whose terms are
  non-commercial.

CLIP tokenizer files (vocab.json, merges.txt)
  https://github.com/openai/CLIP
  MIT License

Geist Pixel font (Resources/Fonts)
  https://vercel.com/font
  SIL Open Font License 1.1
